OL,3,GNEWSAJLR investment a 'vote of
OL,4,Aconfidence' for region
OL,5,
OL,6,FA business leader has described Land
OL,7,FRover's decision to produce a fully
OL,8,Felectric model as a "real vote of
OL,9,Fconfidence" for the Midlands.
OL,11,FThe vehicle manufacturer made the
OL,12,Fannouncement as part of a major shift
OL,13,Fin its electrification programme,
OL,14,Fbacked by largeb@Qscale upgrades across
OL,15,Fits sites.
OL,17,FThe move will be supported by new
OL,18,Fbattery and electric drive unit
OL,19,Fproduction lines, with training being
OL,20,Foffered to about 9,000 employees in
OL,21,FSolihull and a further 1,500 in
OL,22,FWolverhampton.
